--- !u!1001 &109941462
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1147380760}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 709558584998272431, guid: 0da7fe81aa2cd7043a57ab7cab3b9d68, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<color=#8B0000><size=120%>Jan 2nd, Saturday</size></color>\r\nDear
        diary:\r\n\r\nToday's being pretty okay.\r\n\r\nI don't think I've been thinking
        enough...Or maybe...I do?\r\n\r\nThe brewery of wine takes years; so, what
        eventually get compiled from thoughts into ideas might take more.\r\n\r\nI've
        been having a thought for years, and now what I need to do is just, to make
        it come true.\n\n<page>\nGood thing happened today:\n\nI ate icecream. After
        doing this it got freezing cold, though. Maybe I won't ate in during snowy
        day anymore.\n\nIt's 2 :00 am, I've got to sleep now. Bye, my dear diary.
        And sleep well.\n\n\n<page><color=#4B0082><size=120%>Jan 22th, Friday</size></color>\nDear
        Diary:\n\nI haven't been seeing you for half a month.\n\nSometimes, I want
        to walk straight from home to anywhere else, or everywhere, even. Just wandering
        around without having to think about anything.\n\nToday is the second time
        I tried to do so, but I failed. It was just too cold and whever I got further
        away from home, I kinda missed the warmth in the bed.\n\n<page>\nGood thing
        happened today:\n\nI got a new shovel!\n\nNow I can plant the seed sometimes
        when the weather gets warmer.\n\n<page><color=#003366><size=120%>Feb 3rd,
        Wednesday </size></color>\nDear diary:\nToday I felt bored! \n\nI don't have
        much to talk about, honestly. The only thing I think of right now is just
        how fast the days have past. I mean, the last year past in a blink, and even
        now, I never realized until I saw on the calender it's already Feburary.\n\nEvery
        day is plain and, almost the same. I woke up at morning, and went to the
        underground, and back to the surface of the globe again, to work, or just
        taking a walk.\n\n<page>\nGood thing happened today:\n\nNothing happened!
        Just ordinary day, I guess. At least no one has shouted at me for arriving
        late by half an hour. \n\nI didn't mean it! But getting engrossed by the
        concept of passed subway has made me to missed the next one as well.\n\n<page><color=#006400><size=120%>March
        18th, Thursday</size></color>\nToday I learned how to make diary flower.\n\n<page>
        \n\n<page><color=#B8860B><size=120%>????</size></color>\n\n<page>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1179284326247196064, guid: 0da7fe81aa2cd7043a57ab7cab3b9d68, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 94.088715
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
