        And sleep well.\n\n\n<page><color=#4B0082><size=120%>Jan 22th, Friday</size></color>\nDear
        Diary:\n\nI haven't been seeing you for half a month.\n\nSometimes, I want
        to walk straight from home to anywhere else, or everywhere, even. Just wandering
