        Just ordinary day, I guess. At least no one has shouted at me for arriving
        late by half an hour. \n\nI didn't mean it! But getting engrossed by the
        concept of passed subway has made me to missed the next one as well.\n\n<page><color=#006400><size=120%>March
        18th, Thursday</size></color>\nToday I learned how to make diary flower.\n\n<page>
        \n\n<page><color=#B8860B><size=120%>?April?? Monday</size></color>\nDear
        Diary:\n\nToday I want to talk about love, and how love can radiant its warmth
        even in the darkest corner in the room.\n\nIt's getting warmer. I finally
        decided to make the diary flower a real thing.\n\nI don't know what it could
        yield...A strange fruit of love? Or just a strange plant that looks like
        nothing but trash? I'll give it a try no matter what.\n<page>"
