  m_text: "Thank you for playing the demo version of LENS!\n\r\nHope you had fun
    with this game. We're currently in the production of other chapters. Approximately,
    we'll have another 3 main chapters as well as an extra chapter in the future.
    There will also be three different endings (plus one hidden one, spoilers!).
    If you're interested in this game, please look forward to future updates! \n\nHave
    a nice day!\n\n"
